| 12:10:23 | 59257 | 7 = 4B | Finished 12:10:31 |
| 12:20:00 | 59258 | 8 = 4B | Finished 12:20:08 — wrote `plans/latest_plan.json` 12:20:08.861 (1400 B), **the last plan on disk** |
