| instant | event | artifact |
|---|---|---|
| 13:20:06.357 | 4B acquire: `owner=llama-swap-ocho-planner-4b`, need 3800+256, `mode=run`, `ttl 86400`, pid **151226** | `scopes/planner/record.json` birth (13:20 instance) |
